[{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0118","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0118.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"安徽青柿信息科技有限公司 LiveGBS 逻辑缺陷漏洞","description":"LiveGBS 视频网关服务 `/api/v1/user/save` 接口存在逻辑缺陷漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造特制 GET 请求直接添加管理员权限用户（默认密码 12345678），无需任何前置认证即可接管后台管理系统，导致敏感视频数据泄露与服务被控制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2023-CNVD-2023-72138-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2025-08-24T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-08-24T00:00:00Z","remediation":"在官方发布安全补丁前，在 `/api/v1/user/save` 等管理接口添加身份认证与权限校验，禁止未授权访问；同时在网络层面限制管理接口仅对内网或指定 IP 开放，并修改默认口令 `12345678`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0369","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0369.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53159","title":"Rust openssl crate 越界读取漏洞","description":"Rust 语言的 openssl crate 在 0.10.55 之前版本中存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-126），当向 X509VerifyParamRef::set_host 方法传入空字符串时，由于边界检查不完善，程序会触发缓冲区越界读取操作，可能导致敏感内存信息泄露。该漏洞危害等级中等，CVSS 评分 4.5，攻击难度较低，无需特殊权限即可触发，影响了所有使用受影响版本 openssl crate 的 Rust 应用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53159"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-28T03:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:24Z","remediation":"立即将 `openssl` crate 升级到 0.10.55 或更高版本（`cargo update -p openssl`）。如无法立即升级，在调用 `set_host` 前对输入字符串判空，避免传入空字符串触发越界读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://crates.io/crates/openssl","https://github.com/sfackler/rust-openssl/issues/1965","https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2023-0044.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53159.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-53159.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/cargo/openssl/CVE-2023-53159.yml","https://github.com/rustsec/advisory-db/blob/17221a831271520ce57afc4f37ae06b483b24c07/crates/openssl/RUSTSEC-2023-0044.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2023-53159","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53159.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53159.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/github-reviewed/2023/06/GHSA-xcf7-rvmh-g6q4/GHSA-xcf7-rvmh-g6q4.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2023-53159","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53159.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0369.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0368","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0368.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53154","title":"cJSON cJSON 堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞","description":"cJSON 库 1.7.18 之前版本的 `parse_string` 函数存在基于堆的缓冲区越界读取漏洞（CWE-125）。当调用 `cJSON_ParseWithLength` 解析缺少尾随换行符的特制畸形 JSON 输入（如 `{\"1\":1,`）时，触发越界读访问，可能导致进程崩溃或敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需认证即可通过构造恶意 JSON 数据触发该漏洞，影响所有使用受影响 cJSON 版本解析不可信 JSON 输入的应用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.9,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53154"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-23T16:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:24Z","remediation":"升级 cJSON 库至 1.7.18 或更高版本，该版本已修复 parse_string 函数中因缺少换行符导致的堆缓冲区越界读取问题。无法升级时，可在调用 cJSON_ParseWithLength 前对输入尾部添加换行符作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON/compare/v1.7.17...v1.7.18","https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON/issues/800","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/06/msg00014.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-53154.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53154.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/fluent-bit/CVE-2023-53154.patch","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-53154.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2023-53154","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53154.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2023-53154-2025-11-03-1322","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-53154.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-8h4w-44qv-79mq/GHSA-8h4w-44qv-79mq.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2023-53154"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2023/POC-AVE-2023-0368.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0368.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0365","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0365.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53105","title":"Linux Kernel mlx5e 网卡驱动封装锁清理空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mlx5e 驱动在处理封装锁（encap lock）时存在空指针解引用漏洞。当模块卸载过程中仍有对等 tc 流处于 offload 状态时，上游链路 rep 配置文件切换为 nic 配置导致 neigh encap 锁被销毁；后续 VF 代表网卡注销触发非对等 tc 流删除，进而级联删除对等流。对等流删除过程会尝试获取已被销毁的 encap 锁，触发空指针解引用导致内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过构造特定的 tc 流卸载配置触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中 Mellanox mlx5 网卡驱动相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53105"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:18Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.21、6.2.8 或更高版本，其中已合入清理 mlx5e tc eswitch 时清除 peer flow 的修复补丁（commit c9668f0b1d28 / b7350f8dbe0c2）。如无法立即升级内核，可卸载 mlx5_core 模块前先移除所有 tc flower 流表规则避免触发释放后空指针解引用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/01fdaea410787fe372daeaeda93a29ed0606d334","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b7350f8dbe0c2a1d4d3ad7c35b610abd3cb91750","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c9668f0b1d28570327dbba189f2c61f6f9e43ae7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53105.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53105.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53105","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53105.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53105.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53105.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53105.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-w3vx-37cc-jxmm/GHSA-w3vx-37cc-jxmm.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53105","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--787462f9-9e07-4736-8cb8-d0360f12a843.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0365.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0364","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0364.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53093","title":"Linux Kernel 追踪子系统直方图空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核跟踪子系统（tracing）存在空指针解引用漏洞，由于直方图（histogram）值未禁止字符串、堆栈跟踪、符号、分组桶等非法修饰符，本地攻击者可通过 kprobe_events 接口构造含 .buckets 等修饰符的跟踪事件并触发直方图读取操作，导致内核空指针解引用（CWE-476），进而引发系统崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 主线内核多个版本，需具有本地访问权限及 tracing 文件系统操作权限，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。Linux 内核社区已发布修复补丁予以修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53093"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:16Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.23、6.2.8 或更高版本（包含提交 e0213434fe3e、2fc0ee435c92、39cd75f2f3a4 的任一稳定分支），这些版本已禁止直方图值使用不支持的修饰符，可防止触发空指针解引用导致内核崩溃。如无法升级内核，应避免在 tracing 事件中设置使用了 buckets/log/stacktrace 等不支持修饰符的 histogram trigger，特别是针对 kprobe 事件的 vals 字段不要包含 .buckets 等修饰符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2fc0ee435c9264cdb7c5e872f76cd9bb97640227","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/39cd75f2f3a43c0e2f95749eb6dd6420c553f87d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e0213434fe3e4a0d118923dc98d31e7ff1cd9e45","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53093.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53093.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53093","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53093.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53093.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53093.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53093.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-9q9g-hqj4-hvr5/GHSA-9q9g-hqj4-hvr5.json","https://github.com/Alexandre-gng/ANSSI_alerts/blob/70d44ad0e93bb331b572bd411ab72438068e6dba/scraped_data/first/CVE-2023-53093","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70135.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0364.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0363","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53074","title":"AMD Linux Kernel drm/amdgpu PSP 固件缓冲区引用计数错误漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMDGPU 驱动中的 TTM BO 缓冲区管理存在缺陷，在 mode1 重置流程中从挂起到恢复时，TA 固件缓冲区被不必要地重新初始化，导致 bo pin_count 冗余增加。当用户卸载 amdgpu 驱动时触发内核警告（Call Trace），可能引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 AMD GPU 的 Linux 系统，需要本地权限且触发 mode1 重置后卸载驱动才能利用，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。AMD 已在后续内核版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53074"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:14Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.3 及以上版本，或更新至 6.1.21（LTS 分支）、6.2.8（稳定分支）。如无法立即升级，可在加载 amdgpu 模块前通过内核启动参数 `modprobe.blacklist=amdgpu` 临时禁用 AMD GPU 驱动作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/23f4a2d29ba57bf88095f817de5809d427fcbe7e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/55a7c647ebf6e376c45d8322568dd6eb71937139","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7be9a2f8c5179520a7d5570e648e0c97d09e4fae","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53074.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53074.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53074","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53074.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53074.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53074.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53074.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-w37r-4g8q-5548/GHSA-w37r-4g8q-5548.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53074","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70132.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0362","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53072","title":"Linux Kernel MPTCP 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MPTCP（多路径 TCP）协议实现在处理未接受子套接字销毁时存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。由于未正确同步被动套接字的清理过程，在 token 查找时可能访问已释放的内存对象，导致系统崩溃或潜在权限提升。本地攻击者可通过构造特殊的 MPTCP 连接触发此漏洞，影响所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本（6.2-rc5 之前）的系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53072"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:14Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.22、6.2.8 或更高版本。内核 5.7 至 6.1.21 以及 6.2 至 6.2.7 均受影响。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 MPTCP 内核模块（`modprobe -r mptcp`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2827f099b3fb9a59263c997400e9182f5d423e84","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/804cf487fb0031f3c74755b78d8663333f0ba636","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b6985b9b82954caa53f862d6059d06c0526254f0","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53072.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53072.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53072","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53072.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53072.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53072.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53072.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-r22j-fw7c-mp4g/GHSA-r22j-fw7c-mp4g.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53072","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--40f77793-e2b9-4d1c-ac01-160877f44529.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0361","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53068","title":"Linux 内核 lan78xx USB 以太网驱动信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 LAN78XX USB 以太网驱动在处理数据包描述符时存在内存泄漏漏洞。当描述符中指定的数据包长度大于实际套接字缓冲区长度（skb->len）时，驱动会克隆并上报过长的 skb 到网络协议栈，导致内核内存内容泄露。此外，当数据包长度小于以太网 FCS 校验长度时可能触发整数下溢。本地攻击者可通过物理连接恶意 USB 设备或利用特定网络场景触发此漏洞，泄露敏感内核内存信息。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53068"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:14Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.22 及以上版本，或 6.2.9 及以上版本，或 6.3 及以上版本以包含修复 commit 44b9ed73369f/7f247f5a2c18/83de34967473。如无法立即升级，可禁用受影响 LAN78XX USB 网卡驱动（blacklist lan78xx）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/44b9ed73369fc5ec85dd2ee487e986301792a82d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7f247f5a2c18b3f21206cdd51193df4f38e1b9f5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/83de34967473ed31d276381373713cc2869a42e5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53068.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53068.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53068","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53068.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53068.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53068.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53068.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-rhwj-4j44-629j/GHSA-rhwj-4j44-629j.json","https://github.com/Alexandre-gng/ANSSI_alerts/blob/70d44ad0e93bb331b572bd411ab72438068e6dba/scraped_data/first/CVE-2023-53068","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ae471b51-3642-41cc-b6ff-5d5830540cf9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0360","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0360.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53064","title":"Linux 内核 iavf 驱动系统重启挂起漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 iavf 网卡驱动中存在条件竞争漏洞，当搭载 Intel E810 网卡并已创建虚拟功能（VF）的系统进行重启时，iavf_shutdown() 函数先将适配器状态设为 __IAVF_REMOVE，随后 ice 驱动移除流程中调用 iavf_remove() 时，因状态不匹配（非 __IAVF_RUNNING/__IAVF_DOWN/__IAVF_INIT_FAILED）导致进程进入无限休眠，系统永久挂起。本地攻击者可利用系统重启操作触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 iavf 驱动，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53064"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:13Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.3 及以上版本，或针对长期维护分支升级至 5.15.105、6.1.22 或 6.2.9 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，可在重启前先卸载所有 VF 设备（`echo 0 > /sys/class/net/<eth>/device/sriov_numvfs`）避免触发 iavf 驱动状态机死锁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4e264be98b88a6d6f476c11087fe865696e8bef5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/502b898235f06130750c91512c86dd0e9efe28e6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a29799fc141ba9e6cf921fc8e958e3398ad1a4f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f752ace58867de3c063512b21e0f1694fc27f043","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53064.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53064.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53064","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53064.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53064.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-r63h-x8mm-m3m7/GHSA-r63h-x8mm-m3m7.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53064.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53064.json","https://github.com/Alexandre-gng/ANSSI_alerts/blob/70d44ad0e93bb331b572bd411ab72438068e6dba/scraped_data/first/CVE-2023-53064","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-69763.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0360.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0359","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0359.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53042","title":"Linux Kernel AMD Display DRR 设置拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 AMD 显示驱动（DRM/AMD/display）中存在本地拒绝服务漏洞。在 dcn30 显示流水线提交（pipe commit）过程中，若同时对 DRR（动态刷新率）寄存器（如 OTG_V_TOTAL_MIN）进行写操作，会导致显示控制器发生底层缓冲下溢（underflow），造成图形输出异常甚至系统服务不可用。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 4.15 至 6.2.8 之间的多个版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限及低权限用户身份即可触发，无需用户交互。Linux 内核社区已在 6.1.21 及 6.2.8 稳定版中通过补丁修复该问题，禁止在管道提交帧中同时写入 DRR 寄存器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53042"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:11Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.21/6.2.8 及以上版本，或合入修复补丁（commit f8080f1e300e / 3c20a098b507 / 56574f89dbd）。如无法立即更新内核，可通过 kernel livepatch 热修复或限制本地低权限用户加载 amdgpu 内核模块作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3c20a098b507020936e02a98f4fbb924deeef44b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/56574f89dbd84004c3fd6485bcaafb5aa9b8be14","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f8080f1e300e7abcc03025ec8b5bab69ae98daaa","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53042.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53042.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53042","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53042.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53042.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53042.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53042.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-f7cg-36w8-gm8h/GHSA-f7cg-36w8-gm8h.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53042","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cc5b8aab-dcca-4dfe-92d0-9476aaad36c9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0359.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0358","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0358.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53037","title":"Linux 内核 mpi3mr SCSI 驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mpi3mr 驱动在处理故障磁盘时释放了 HBA 端口数据结构的内存，但未清除相关指针引用，导致释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当固件再次发送设备信息变更事件时，驱动会访问已释放内存，引发内存损坏和内核崩溃。本地攻击者可利用故障设备触发该漏洞实现拒绝服务，影响启用 SAS Transport Layer 支持的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53037"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:10Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.22+、6.2.9+ 或 6.3+ 版本，或 cherry-pick 提交 1f822ae8fb2a（主线）、aa11e4b6cdb（6.1.y）、8e45183978d6（6.2.y）到当前内核并重新编译部署。如无法升级，可通过 modprobe.blacklist=mpi3mr 内核参数禁用 mpi3mr 驱动模块作为临时缓解，但将导致该 SAS HBA 不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f822ae8fb2a20fffa71e9bfa9b203c03d72d3ba","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8e45183978d64699df639e795235433a60f35047","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aa11e4b6cdb403b9fdef6939550f6b36dd61624d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53037.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53037.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53037","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53037.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53037.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53037.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53037.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-2px8-v868-2g2q/GHSA-2px8-v868-2g2q.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53037","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fb3f3b64-c029-4988-8356-ab63ce73692d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0358.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0335","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0335.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-26819","title":"cJSON 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"cJSON 1.7.15 版本在解析 JSON 文档时存在拒绝服务漏洞。当 JSON 中包含超长整数（如 9999999999999999999999999999999999999999999999912345678901234567）时，parse_number 函数使用固定 64 字节栈缓冲区复制数字字符串，超长数字导致缓冲区溢出前的循环遍历消耗大量 CPU 资源，造成服务不响应。攻击者可通过向目标应用提交特制 JSON 数据触发该漏洞。此漏洞影响所有使用 cJSON 库解析用户输入 JSON 数据的应用程序，CVSS 评分 2.9，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.9,"aliases":["CVE-2023-26819"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-04-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 cJSON 升级至 1.7.16 或更高版本（最新版为 1.7.19），该版本已通过动态分配缓冲区修复超大数字导致解析崩溃的问题（commit a328d65）。Debian Bullseye 用户可升级至 1.7.14-1+deb11u2，Bookworm 用户可升级至 1.7.15-1+deb12u3，详见 DLA-4216-1。若无法升级，接入外部 JSON 前使用独立线程并设置超时（如 5 秒），或在应用层对数值字段做范围校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-26819","https://github.com/boofish/json_bugs/tree/main/cjson","https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON/commit/a328d65ad490b64da8c87523cbbfe16050ba5bf6","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/06/msg00014.html","https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-26819"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0335.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0357","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53034","title":"Linux kernel ntb_hw_switchtec 驱动越界移位漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 ntb_hw_switchtec 驱动中存在移出边界漏洞，当调用 ntb_mw_clear_trans() API 时传入 addr 和 size 均为 0，导致 xlate_pos 计算为负数，从而在 BIT() 宏中触发负数位移操作，引发未定义行为。该漏洞源于 switchtec_ntb_mw_set_trans 函数未对 xlate_pos 进行有效性检查。本地攻击者可通过触发 NTB 内存窗口清除操作利用此漏洞，可能导致系统崩溃或信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53034"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-16T15:15:52Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:09Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级到以下已包含补丁的稳定版本：5.4.292、5.10.236、5.15.180、6.1.134、6.6.87、6.12.23、6.13.11、6.14.2 及以上对应分支的最新版本。补丁 commit 为 de203da734fa（主线）及各稳定分支对应的 backport 提交。对于无法立即升级的系统，可通过模块黑名单临时禁用 switchtec 驱动（echo \"blacklist switchtec\" > /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-switchtec.conf），但此措施将禁用 NTB 功能，仅作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0df2e03e4620548b41891b4e0d1bd9d2e0d8a39a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2429bdf26a0f3950fdd996861e9c1a3873af1dbe","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36d32cfb00d42e865396424bb5d340fc0a28870d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5b6857bb3bfb0dae17fab1e42c1e82c204a508b1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7ed22f8d8be26225a78cf5e85b2036421a6bf2d5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c61a3f2df162ba424be0141649a9ef5f28eaccc1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cb153bdc1812a3375639ed6ca5f147eaefb65349","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/de203da734fae00e75be50220ba5391e7beecdf9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f56951f211f181410a383d305e8d370993e45294","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00045.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-53034.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53034.json","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/1e75ff0431232917a0e7a98e561dc047ca333983/frontend/__mocks__/operatingSystemsMock.ts","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53034.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-53034","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ee0faf64b77ff7a5d60107543287bfbcf4a3c8bf/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53034.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53034.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2023-53034-2025-11-03-1325","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-53034.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53034.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0357.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0355","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53010","title":"Linux kernel bnxt 驱动缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 bnxt_en 网卡驱动中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞位于 bnxt_ethtool_init.c 函数中，测试名称拼接时读取超出首个名称末尾，触发了内核缓冲区溢出检测机制，导致系统崩溃。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核主线版本已通过重构 hwrm_selftest_qlist_output 结构体为实际数组、并使用 snprintf() 替代 strncat() 的方式修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53010"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:50Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:06Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.15.94 及以上版本，或合入 commit 0f4a9a7b 补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过内核模块黑名单禁用 bnxt_en 模块：echo \"blacklist bnxt_en\" > /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-bnxt.conf，重启后临时规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cefa85480ac99c0bef5a09daadb48d65fc28e279","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d3e599c090fc6977331150c5f0a69ab8ce87da21","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53010.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53010.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-53010","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53010.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53010.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53010.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53010.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-v743-mw8q-3h6g/GHSA-v743-mw8q-3h6g.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53010","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-69479.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0355.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0354","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0354.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53009","title":"Linux 内核 AMD KFD 驱动 VRAM 对象创建后同步缺失漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 drm/amdkfd 驱动在创建 VRAM BO（缓冲区对象）后缺少同步机制，导致 SVM（共享虚拟内存）分配的显存初始化未完成时，应用程序写入该内存会触发数据损坏。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成敏感信息泄露或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。开发者通过增加同步等待初始化完成来修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53009"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:06Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.9 或更高版本（稳定分支对应提交 92af2d3b57a1，主线分支对应提交 ba029e9991d9），或向后移植补丁到 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdkfd/kfd_svm.c 中在创建 VRAM BO 后添加同步等待初始化完成。如无法升级，可在 SVM 场景下限制应用对 VRAM 的直接写入操作作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","refe